pdf: match Acrobat/pdf.js defaults when synthesising annotation appearances

Highlight without /C uses Acrobat yellow. Text markup without QuadPoints
falls back to /Rect. Square/Circle with width 0 and no fill are skipped
(hairline). Movie /Poster image streams become the appearance.

